SOURCE DATA

The synthetic recordings are derived by oscillator resynthesis from the
Sleep-EDF Database Expanded (Sleep Cassette), PhysioNet, distributed under the
Open Data Commons Attribution License v1.0 (ODC-BY). See DATASET_DESCRIPTION.md
for full source attribution (Kemp et al., 2000; Goldberger et al., 2000).

